sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Entry as Telegram / CLI
    participant Hub as Agent Hub
    participant Reg as Specialist contracts
    participant Ctx as Project context
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant Graph as Hub LangGraph
    participant Specialist as Eligible specialist tool

    You->>Entry: operator request
    Entry->>Hub: forward message

    Hub->>Reg: read current advertised task kinds
    Reg-->>Hub: enabled specialist contracts
    Hub->>Hub: LLM classifies route + task_kind
    Hub->>Hub: validate task_kind is advertised
    Hub->>Reg: deterministically filter by task_kind
    Reg-->>Hub: eligible specialist set

    Hub->>Ctx: resolve target project safely
    Ctx-->>Hub: canonical project context or safe error
    Hub->>Runs: reject conflicting active work or create task run

    alt specialist route
        Hub->>Graph: build graph with eligible specialist tools only
        Graph->>Specialist: invoke selected eligible tool
        Specialist-->>Graph: progress / pause / structured result
        Graph-->>Hub: specialist result
        opt success includes next_task
            Hub->>Hub: validate next_task deterministically
            Hub->>Reg: confirm next task_kind is currently routable
            Reg-->>Hub: routable or fail closed
            Hub->>Runs: preserve validated next_task
            Note over Hub,Runs: Phase 1 stops here — no follow-on dispatch
        end
    else direct / clarify route
        Hub->>Graph: build graph without specialist tools
        Graph-->>Hub: direct reply or clarification
    end

    Hub->>Runs: persist final or paused state
    Hub-->>Entry: operator-facing response
    Entry-->>You: result / question / approval prompt
